<p class="c0"><span class="c1"><b>Sales Rep Workflow Notifications - English Version for Plan Acceptance</b></span></p>
<p class="c2"><br></p>
<p class="c0"><span class="c1">Hi </span><span class="c1"><b>,</b></span></p>
<p class="c2"><br></p>
<p class="c0"><span class="c1">Your new Individual Compensation Agreement and accompanying Terms and Conditions are ready for your review and acceptance! If you have any questions, please visit the Sales Compensation Portal or reach out to your manager. And please, make sure to review and accept your Individual Compensation Agreement (ICA) within one week of receipt of this email to ensure you don't experience delays or nonpayment of commission or bonuses. </span></p>
<p class="c2"><br></p>
<p class="c0"><span class="c1">To begin, please log in to the </span><a href="https://salescomp.oracle.com/"><span class="c3">Sales Compensation Portal</span></a><span class="c1">, then take the following actions:</span></p>
<p class="c2"><br></p>
<ol class="c4">
<li><p class="c5"><span class="c1">Click 'Review Plan' in the banner at the top of the homepage. </span></p>
</li>
<li><p class="c5"><span class="c1">Read and acknowledge the Terms and Conditions associated with your ICA by selecting the check box next to 'I have reviewed the Terms and Conditions'. Then click 'Continue' at the bottom of the document. </span></p>
</li>
<li><p class="c5"><span class="c1">Please review your ICA when it appears on your screen. Following review of your ICA, please take one of the below actions:</span></p>
</li>
<li><p class="c5"><span class="c1">To accept, select the check the boxes next to 'I have reviewed the Individualized Compensation Agreement' and 'I have reviewed and accept my Compensation Plan.' Then click 'Accept Plan &amp; Finish'</span></p>
</li>
<li><p class="c5"><span class="c1">If you believe there is an error, please contact your manager before progressing or clicking anything on this screen.</span></p>
</li>
</ol><p class="c6"><br></p>
<p class="c0"><span class="c1">Note: The currency displayed is the currency in which you will be compensated. If you sell exclusively into a country other than where you reside, your compensation currency will be issued from the country you are selling into (not the country in which you reside).</span></p>
<p class="c2"><br></p>
<p class="c0"><span class="c1">Once you have accepted the Plan, you will see that its status will change to &quot;Accepted.&quot; This can be verified by clicking the &quot;My Comp Plan&quot; button on the homepage of the Sales Compensation Portal. </span></p>
<p class="c2"><br></p>
<p class="c0"><span class="c1">Training is available for this Plan acceptance process in </span><a href="https://eeho.fa.us2.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/faces/FuseWelcome?_afrLoop=19280794777265993&amp;_afrWindowMode=0&amp;_afrWindowId=null&amp;_adf.ctrl-state=b7s6n9oym_1&amp;_afrFS=16&amp;_afrMT=screen&amp;_afrMFW=1440&amp;_afrMFH=757&amp;_afrMFDW=1440&amp;_afrMFDH=900&amp;_afrMFC=8&amp;_afrMFCI=0&amp;_afrMFM=0&amp;_afrMFR=96&amp;_afrMFG=0&amp;_afrMFS=0&amp;_afrMFO=0"><span class="c3">Oracle Learning</span></a><span class="c1"> by searching &quot;Sales Compensation&quot;.</span></p>
<p class="c2"><br></p>
<p class="c7"><span class="c1"><b>If you have a sales territory in FY26, it has been created and is awaiting your acknowledgement.&nbsp; Please navigate to </b></span><a href="https://fusioncrm.oracle.com/homePage"><span class="c3">https://fusioncrm.oracle.com/homePage</span></a><span class="c1"> </span><span class="c1"><b>and select FY26 Territory acknowledgement</b></span><span class="c1">.</span><a name="page-total-master0" id="page-total-master0"></a><a name="page-total" id="page-total"></a></p>
</body>
